### Get all dishes
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dishes

### Get dish by id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dishes/1

### Get dishes by restaurant
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dishes?restaurantId=1

### Create dish
POST http://localhost:3000/api/dishes
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Doro Wat",
    "priceSantim": 85000,
    "restaurantId": 1
}

### Create dish with missing restaurant
POST http://localhost:3000/api/dishes
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Kitfo",
    "priceSantim": 90000,
    "restaurantId": 999
}